{"id":"neudivitel_no","lemma":"неудивительно","pos":"adv","rank":2178,"glosses":["unsurprisingly, no wonder, small wonder"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5e/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Rominf-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Rominf-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Неудивительно, что она не хотела идти.","en":"It is no wonder that she didn't want to go.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Неудивительно, что ты никому не нравишься.","en":"No wonder no one likes you.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"}]},{"text":"Это неудивительно.","en":"This is no surprise.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Неудивительно, что его арестовали.","en":"No wonder he was arrested.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to arrest","l":"арестовать"}]},{"text":"Неудивительно, что он провалился.","en":"It is no wonder that he failed.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},null]}]}